## Structural result before model statistics

[RUN] The exact bounded catalogue contains 36,788 candidates at 37 anchors.
The coalition-size distribution is:

| `|A|` | rows | share of full catalogue |
|---:|---:|---:|
| 0 | 37 | 0.101% |
| 1 | 28,960 | 78.721% |
| 2 | 7,104 | 19.311% |
| 3 | 292 | 0.794% |
