## Parity starts

### `RSS_MAX`

- Canonical construction: get complete decision-instant legal options with `runner._legal_options`; for each user select the legal identity with maximum boundary-0 `arrays.nominal_gain`, breaking a tie by declared legal-option ordinal ([BASIN2 lines 178–217](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-basin-ws/.scratch/basin2/run_basin2.py:178)). Build the profile with `runner._configuration`.
