- Exact construction is reusable without any learner data. `minimum_cover` is deterministic exact set cover with dominated-set pruning and a cardinality-increasing exact search ([CROWDCOST lines 130–216](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-crowd-ws/.scratch/crowding-cost/run_crowding_cost.py:130)). `nested_beam_sets` begins with that cover and extends it via augmenting paths to the exact matching rank ([lines 219–282](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-crowd-ws/.scratch/crowding-cost/run_crowding_cost.py:219)). `assignment_for_beams` activates every selected beam with a distinct witness and assigns remaining users coverage-first ([lines 285–310](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-crowd-ws/.scratch/crowding-cost/run_crowding_cost.py:285)). For the most-crowded endpoint, use `minimum_cover(options)` then `assignment_for_beams(options, cover)`; the extension is only needed to reproduce the whole ladder.
