- Endpoint requirement: after all candidate identities are fixed, use one **separate** fresh realised dense full-48 evaluator and one `evaluate_many` containing BASE plus every candidate/end start; then read cache only. BASIN2's endpoint helper is the closest template ([lines 929–950](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-basin-ws/.scratch/basin2/run_basin2.py:929)). Its completed receipt records the invariants and zero scalar calls ([receipt lines 164110–164124](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-basin-ws/.scratch/basin2/basin2-receipt.json:164110)).
