- Declared aggregate census: 36,788 rows at 37 anchors; `|A|=1` is 28,960 (78.721%), `|A|=2` is 7,104 (19.311%), and the full size distribution includes sizes 3–8 and 74 size-100 rows ([C3 declaration lines 7–30](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-DECLARED-TARGET-LEARNABILITY-2026-09-10.md:7)). Thus `|A|<=2` is 98.133%, but **size alone is not exact membership**.
